WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.145
A hollow blown by young stars.

00:02.859 --> 00:10.441
Nearly two thousand light-years across, it is gas lit and pushed by young stars, whose winds have blown a hollow in its middle.

00:11.023 --> 00:16.195
Its depth here is a model; its pink hydrogen and teal oxygen are made stronger.
